# Phase implementation

- One sub-phase = one PR, **≤5 files**
- Mirror GitLab (`templates/gitlab/jobs/`) and GitHub (`templates/github/workflows/jobs/`)
- Shared contract: `config/security-gate-policy.yaml` + SARIF + `scripts/gate-check.py`
- **warn → block** in a separate micro-PR after burn-in
- WAF/RASP (F2): runbooks only, never CI jobs
- Update `docs/phases/*.md` acceptance criteria when hardening
- Follow `.cursor/plans/devsecops-execution.plan.md` todo order
